ldapbrowser is an LDAP browser bash application version 1.1.0

Usage: ldapbrowser <command>

Commands:
	version			Show ldapbrowser version information
	describe		Show ldapbrowser description information
	setup			Set up and manage the required ldapbrowser configuration settings
					It has subcommands: reset, backup and restore
					to reset/backup/restore the/to the active configuration
	completion		Generate autocompletion script for bash
	debug			Set on/off debug log (useful for network and application issues debug, LDAP queries detailed content and others)
	themes			Set up current ldapbrowser colour theme
	list			List an LDAP directory tree starting from the defined branch
	help			Show this help message

Examples:
	ldapbrowser version
	ldapbrowser describe
	ldapbrowser help
	ldapbrowser
	ldapbrowser setup
	ldapbrowser setup reset
	ldapbrowser setup backup
	ldapbrowser setup restore
	ldapbrowser debug on
	ldapbrowser debug off
	ldapbrowser themes
	ldapbrowser list
